Okay, I looked through the output of the MP memory-map command in the
boot ROM. The only thing that changes in the device-register section
when this card is installed is that it adds eight words from
17772518-17772536 (there's already one at 17772516, so it shows as a
contiguous nine-word area.) The RQDX1, on the other hand, lives at
17772150-17772152. Maybe they share an interrupt and that's why
